  "prefLabel": "Plc 1301.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1301.02 Applicability. This chapter shall apply to any individual who intends to practice or who does practice in the professions regulated under RSA 328-J, subject to the exemptions listed in RSA 328-J:25, reprinted in Appendix E.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
